      {
        "id": 17564,
        "title": "HTML Tree and Nodes",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148942,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tree data structures like the one below are commonly used in game development to represent data and relationships in a <strong>hierarchical</strong> way.</p><p>In games, a scene graph helps us see how sprites, UI, and effects are connected.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148943,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We call each element of a tree a <strong>node</strong>, like a <code>player</code> sprite node.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148944,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We represent objects in a game scene as <strong>nodes</strong> of the tree. For example, a <code>scene</code> and a <code>sprite</code> are tree <strong>nodes</strong>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"96\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"scene\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"layer\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;game&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"sprite\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;player&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"HP: 100 \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"sprite\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"layer\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"scene\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;layer name=\"game\"&gt;</code> followed by <code>&lt;sprite name=\"player\"&gt;</code> and then <code>&lt;/sprite&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;/layer&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148945,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>There are several types of nodes. We call <code>scene</code> the <strong>root node</strong> because it's the start of the tree.</p><p>There can only be one, top level <strong>root node</strong>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148946,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Elements like <code>sprite</code> are called <strong>element nodes</strong>. We consider the label inside a <strong>text node</strong> even though it doesn't have the <code>&lt;</code> and <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148947,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Each piece of text in the scene markup appears as a text node. For example, the texts in the <code>title</code> and the HUD <code>label</code> are text nodes.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"102\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"scene\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"ui\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   Dungeon Dash\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"ui\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"hud\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"label\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   Score: 0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"label\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"hud\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"scene\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>Dungeon Dash</code>, followed by <code>Score:</code>, and finally <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148948,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What do we use tree data structures for?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">To represent data and relationships in a hierarchical way</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">To represent data in a linear way</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">To represent data and relationships in a hierarchical way.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148949,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What do we call the objects that make up a game scene tree?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nodes</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Branches</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick Nodes.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148950,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>How does the scene tree represent a <code>sprite</code> and a <code>label</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">As nodes</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">As text</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">As nodes.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148951,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What is the root node of this game scene tree?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>scene</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>layer</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>scene</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148952,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What part of this code is a text node?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"scene\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"ui\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Quest Log\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"ui\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"scene\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The text <code>Quest Log</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The <code>title</code> element</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The text <code>Quest Log</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148953,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Add the root node to start the scene.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"scene\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"scene\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;</code> followed by <code>scene</code> and then <code>&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;/</code>, <code>scene</code>, <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148954,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Add one <code>label</code> element node followed by one <code>label</code> element node below it.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"118\" endIndex=\"120\" /><option startIndex=\"120\" endIndex=\"125\" /><option startIndex=\"125\" endIndex=\"126\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"scene\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"ui\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"label\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Level Up! New skill unlocked.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"label\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"label\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"New quest: Defeat the cave boss.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"label\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"ui\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"scene\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;label&gt;</code> followed by <code>&lt;/label&gt;</code> and then <code>&lt;</code>, <code>label</code>, <code>&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;/</code>, <code>label</code>, <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 148955,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Add a text node to each <code>label</code> element node. Start with <code>Collect 10 coins</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"104\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"scene\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"ui\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"label\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   Collect 10 coins\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"label\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"label\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   Find a health potion\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"label\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"ui\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"scene\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>Collect 10 coins</code>, followed by <code>Find a health potion</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17565,
        "title": "Node Relations",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148956,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We've learned about the HTML document tree structure, nodes, and their types. Now let's look into how nodes <em>relate</em> to each other.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148957,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We refer to nodes as being in a <strong>parent-child relationship</strong> if they are connected and there are no other nodes between them.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148958,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In this example, <code>html</code> is the parent of <code>body</code>, but <em>not</em> the parent of <code>p</code> or <code>h1</code>.</p><p><code>body</code> is a child of <code>html</code>. <code>h1</code> and <code>p</code> are children of <code>body</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148959,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We create a child node by nesting an element inside another. The <code>p</code> element is inside the <code>body</code> element so it's a child of <code>body</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"118\" endIndex=\"121\" /><option startIndex=\"141\" endIndex=\"145\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Quest Runner HUD\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Level 1: Forest Path\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Health: 3 | Score: 0\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;p&gt;</code>, followed by <code>&lt;/p&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148960,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A node is <strong>descendant</strong> of another node if there is a connection between them, even if there are other nodes in between.</p><p>Here, all nodes are <strong>descendants</strong> of the <code>html</code> node.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148961,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We create descendant nodes by nesting elements inside each other. <code>li</code> is inside <code>ul</code> which is inside the <code>body</code>.</p><p> Which element is <code>li</code> also a <strong>descendant</strong> of?</p><code name=\"index1.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Quest Runner HUD\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Inventory\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Items you picked up in this level.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"ul\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"li\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Health Potion\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"li\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"ul\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>html</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>head</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>h1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>html</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148962,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Two nodes are <strong>siblings</strong> if they share the same parent, like <code>h1</code> and <code>p</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148963,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Here, <code>h1</code> and <code>p</code> are sibling nodes because they appear nested inside the same parent, <code>body</code>.</p><p>Which nodes are <em>siblings</em>?</p><code name=\"index1.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Quest Runner HUD\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Pause Menu\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Press R to restart the level.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>p</code> and <code>h1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>title</code> and <code>h1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>title</code> and <code>p</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>p</code> and <code>h1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148964,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Is the <code>body</code> element node the <em>parent</em> of the <code>li</code> element node?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  Player Stats \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"ul\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"li\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"HP: 3\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"li\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"ul\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">No, because the <code>li</code> is nested inside <code>ul</code>, and not <strong>directly</strong> inside the <code>body</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yes, because the <code>li</code> is inside the <code>body</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">No, because the <code>li</code> is nested inside <code>ul</code>, and not <strong>directly</strong> inside the <code>body</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148965,
